  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Clock Components Kit contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Maker World Clock. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of the Maker World Clock and obtain detailed information, please visit the Maker World Clock on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/Clock_Components_Kit.zip?v=1718872610\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/3d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a> <!-- 查看PDF结束 --></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><!-- 文案布局 --></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <strong>Clock Components Kit</strong> contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Maker World Clock</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.</p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 96px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 459.266px;\"><strong>Compatible Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 140.641px;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 248.094px;\"><b>Model Links</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 459.266px;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\">Maker World Clock</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 140.641px;\">B-Lab 3D</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 248.094px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/models/134036\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Maker World Clock</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 459.266px;\">Rotating dial clock</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 140.641px;\">simas1017</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 248.094px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/519838\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Rotating dial clock</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 459.266px; text-align: justify;\">Waveform Modern Minimalist Desk Clock</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 140.641px;\">Mike.stl</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 248.094px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1596456-waveform-a-modern-minimalist-desk-clock-no-ams?from=search#profileId-1681940\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Waveform Desk Clock</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 459.266px; text-align: justify;\">Royal POP - Wall Clock</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 140.641px;\">josteb</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 248.094px;\"><a href='https://makerworld.com/en/models/2813407-audemars-piguet-x-swatch-royal-pop-wall-clock#profileId-3136609\"' rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Royal POP - Wall Clock</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"></p>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span>To download the model files of the <strong>Maker World Clock</strong></span><span> and obtain detailed information, please visit the </span><strong>Maker World Clock</strong><span> on </span><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/models/134036\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span>.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span><img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/84c23f2beb4f479cb290f0e0341f5d1c.png\" src=\"