><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span> 1 PCS </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 417.031px;\">Hex Socket Nut</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 107.234px;\"><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span> 1 PCS </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 417.031px;\">M3x12 SHCS Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 107.234px;\"><span>/</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span>20 PCS</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span> / </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 417.031px;\">M3 Carbon Steel Hex Nut</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 107.234px;\"><span>/</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span>20 PCS</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 101.562px;\"><span>/ </span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第五条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Notes</h3>\nPlease note that the Clock Components Kit <strong>does not come with batteries</strong>. Please bring your own AA battery to power the clock.</div>\n<br/><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 38px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 184.479px;