  "description_text": "The Clock Components Kit contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Maker World Clock. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts.\n\nTo download the model files of the Maker World Clock and obtain detailed information, please visit the Maker World Clock on MakerWorld.",
